.idea

# NOTE: .env is deliberately NOT ignored. Quasar reads it at build time and
# inlines every VITE_* value into the bundle, so excluding it would produce an
# image whose Keycloak configuration is empty — the "[keycloak] Missing config"
# failure, baked in permanently.
.env.local*
